(4979995, 726074, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good strong clean image - like your finish/processing.  Tones are good too.  The ''tear'' seems oversized - but perhaps adds to the overall ''oddness''.  Excellent composition .. although maybe a little less knife/knife handle for added ''abstractness''... who knows.</td>', '7 - Good strong clean image - like your finish/processing.  Tones are good too.  The ''tear'' seems oversized - but perhaps adds to the overall ''oddness''.  Excellent composition .. although maybe a little less knife/knife handle for added ''abstractness''... who knows.', '2008-09-29 08:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980008, 725842, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice image, like the lines with the beads of water.  Shame about the bottom left corner, a few issues there which dominate the image a little too much.  The abstract is nice, but your title distracts me from ''feeling'' any instant emotional connection - for this Challenge.</td>', '5 - Nice image, like the lines with the beads of water.  Shame about the bottom left corner, a few issues there which dominate the image a little too much.  The abstract is nice, but your title distracts me from ''feeling'' any instant emotional connection - for this Challenge.', '2008-09-29 08:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
