(4980564, 726080, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I really like this. Nice colours; makes me think less of desire and more of romanticism.</td>', 'Beautiful, I really like this. Nice colours; makes me think less of desire and more of romanticism.', '2008-09-29 16:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980568, 725535, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good image, but I failed to gather (1) why it is an abstract image and (2) what emotion it depicts.</td>', 'Good image, but I failed to gather (1) why it is an abstract image and (2) what emotion it depicts.', '2008-09-29 16:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980570, 725866, 97270, '<td valign="top">I fail to gather how a distinctive facial expression represents an abstract emotion (with stress on ''abstract'').</td>', 'I fail to gather how a distinctive facial expression represents an abstract emotion (with stress on ''abstract'').', '2008-09-29 16:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980571, 725728, 97270, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but it would have been truly abstract with only the fingers in the frame. As of now, it is only a snapshot, no abstraction in the image itself.</td>', 'Neat idea, but it would have been truly abstract with only the fingers in the frame. As of now, it is only a snapshot, no abstraction in the image itself.', '2008-09-29 16:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980574, 725534, 97270, '<td valign="top">Sorry I didnt get this image.</td>', 'Sorry I didnt get this image.', '2008-09-29 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980575, 725983, 97270, '<td valign="top">A great image otherwise... just not abstract enough for my taste.</td>', 'A great image otherwise... just not abstract enough for my taste.', '2008-09-29 16:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980576, 725586, 97270, '<td valign="top">How is this abstract? And what emotion does it convey?</td>', 'How is this abstract? And what emotion does it convey?', '2008-09-29 16:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980577, 726021, 97270, '<td valign="top">It would qualify as weakly abstract in my opinion. Nice camera angle, weak lighting, nice contrast. But the abstraction is missing.</td>', 'It would qualify as weakly abstract in my opinion. Nice camera angle, weak lighting, nice contrast. But the abstraction is missing.', '2008-09-29 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980580, 725926, 97270, '<td valign="top">A nice find there! Lighting, contrast, focus, all elements could be improved I think.</td>', 'A nice find there! Lighting, contrast, focus, all elements could be improved I think.', '2008-09-29 16:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980582, 726016, 97270, '<td valign="top">A great shot. Very colorful, and along the lines of being a true abstract image (though not quite there:-)</td>', 'A great shot. Very colorful, and along the lines of being a true abstract image (though not quite there:-)', '2008-09-29 16:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980585, 725294, 97270, '<td valign="top">I am ratiing this image high on a second thought.. just on the quality of work.... even though I dont get the emotion you want to portray here. Good job!</td>', 'I am ratiing this image high on a second thought.. just on the quality of work.... even though I dont get the emotion you want to portray here. Good job!', '2008-09-29 16:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980586, 726087, 97270, '<td valign="top">It is arguably abstract.. but it doesnt convey or stir any emotions in me.</td>', 'It is arguably abstract.. but it doesnt convey or stir any emotions in me.', '2008-09-29 16:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980588, 726086, 97270, '<td valign="top">I totally missed the theme of this one. Good image... I would think a total B/W would make it more powerful though. Good work.</td>', 'I totally missed the theme of this one. Good image... I would think a total B/W would make it more powerful though. Good work.', '2008-09-29 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980591, 725312, 97270, '<td valign="top">Uh... why is this an abstract image? Good shot otherwise... I like the DOF.</td>', 'Uh... why is this an abstract image? Good shot otherwise... I like the DOF.', '2008-09-29 16:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980592, 725553, 97270, '<td valign="top">It conveys more of a delightful feeling to me than panic, sorry. The image itself is nice... I like the red shades... and the artistic presentation!</td>', 'It conveys more of a delightful feeling to me than panic, sorry. The image itself is nice... I like the red shades... and the artistic presentation!', '2008-09-29 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980596, 726050, 97270, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture in my opinion.. just not abstract enough for me, sorry. Still would get a medium high score from me.</td>', 'A beautiful picture in my opinion.. just not abstract enough for me, sorry. Still would get a medium high score from me.', '2008-09-29 16:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980598, 725988, 66384, '<td valign="top">This made me smile when it opened. I don''t really feel the anger, but I understand the green/envy aspect. Anyway, I think the image is abstract and I felt happy when I saw it, so I believe you did a good job of meeting this challenge.</td>', 'This made me smile when it opened. I don''t really feel the anger, but I understand the green/envy aspect. Anyway, I think the image is abstract and I felt happy when I saw it, so I believe you did a good job of meeting this challenge.', '2008-09-29 16:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980599, 725195, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great idea... just doesnt go along with the /abstraction/ theme in my opinion. I would rate the image high on technique, but low on meeting the topic.</td>', 'Great idea... just doesnt go along with the /abstraction/ theme in my opinion. I would rate the image high on technique, but low on meeting the topic.', '2008-09-29 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980600, 726013, 66384, '<td valign="top">I feel a flood of something bad. Good job of meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I feel a flood of something bad. Good job of meeting the challenge.', '2008-09-29 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980601, 726085, 97270, '<td valign="top">Huh? It is arguably abstract (weakly in my opinion)... but what emotion does it stir, or convey? Good shot otherwise..I like the yellows.</td>', 'Huh? It is arguably abstract (weakly in my opinion)... but what emotion does it stir, or convey? Good shot otherwise..I like the yellows.', '2008-09-29 16:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980604, 725531, 66384, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem abstract to me although it does evoke an emotion -- sorrow.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem abstract to me although it does evoke an emotion -- sorrow.', '2008-09-29 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980607, 725983, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything abstract about this image. I like the image, but cannot give is a high mark for this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see anything abstract about this image. I like the image, but cannot give is a high mark for this challenge.', '2008-09-29 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980608, 726013, 97270, '<td valign="top">I totally missed this one on my first pass through the images. What a work of art it is... resembles <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=74588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cutout</a>''s style... but nevertheless, it is a superbly executed idea. The idea is great, and it works.. it just works. Three cheers!</td>', 'I totally missed this one on my first pass through the images. What a work of art it is... resembles  cutout''s style... but nevertheless, it is a superbly executed idea. The idea is great, and it works.. it just works. Three cheers!', '2008-09-29 16:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980610, 725867, 66384, '<td valign="top">It looks happy and also delicious. Nice job of meeting the challenge.</td>', 'It looks happy and also delicious. Nice job of meeting the challenge.', '2008-09-29 16:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980611, 724162, 55956, '<td valign="top">more a macro that an abstract</td>', 'more a macro that an abstract', '2008-09-29 16:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980613, 725785, 55956, '<td valign="top">onestely i can''t see an abstract here.</td>', 'onestely i can''t see an abstract here.', '2008-09-29 16:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980615, 726059, 55956, '<td valign="top">interesting image</td>', 'interesting image', '2008-09-29 16:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980616, 725555, 55956, '<td valign="top">I like this, a good interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'I like this, a good interpretation of the challenge', '2008-09-29 16:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980619, 725849, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the processing here. Not very abstract to me, but it definitely invokes an emotion -- love passed, nostalgia. I really like it a lot so I''m going to give it a high score.</td>', 'I love the processing here. Not very abstract to me, but it definitely invokes an emotion -- love passed, nostalgia. I really like it a lot so I''m going to give it a high score.', '2008-09-29 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980620, 726054, 55956, '<td valign="top">seems that there is a little problem with the white balance</td>', 'seems that there is a little problem with the white balance', '2008-09-29 16:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980622, 725905, 66384, '<td valign="top">This makes me laugh. Quite a different take on the challenge. I like the image.</td>', 'This makes me laugh. Quite a different take on the challenge. I like the image.', '2008-09-29 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980623, 724884, 55956, '<td valign="top">wow, this photo is good. as personal opinion perhaps bur even the border of the man could be a better choice but it''s only an opinion. 10</td>', 'wow, this photo is good. as personal opinion perhaps bur even the border of the man could be a better choice but it''s only an opinion. 10', '2008-09-29 16:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980626, 726069, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It is definitely abstract, and has a cold and desperate feel.</td>', 'Very nice. It is definitely abstract, and has a cold and desperate feel.', '2008-09-29 16:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980629, 726085, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract. I don''t see or feel any emotion.</td>', 'Lovely abstract. I don''t see or feel any emotion.', '2008-09-29 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980632, 725276, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely and fearful.</td>', 'Lovely and fearful.', '2008-09-29 16:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980639, 724919, 71239, '<td valign="top">You''re breaking my heart on this one.  This is a gorgeous animal portrait, beautiful expression, delicate lighting that works brilliantly in black and white and the contrast between the silky hair and the roughness of the background is just fantastic. In a free study it would be an instant 10, but I''m just struggling with the abstract angle on the shot as it the very directness of the image that gives it it''s power.<br/> <br/>But ignore me and this challenge - for crying out loud just get this into a major exhibition, get it published, just get it out there where it deserves to be.</td>', 'You''re breaking my heart on this one.  This is a gorgeous animal portrait, beautiful expression, delicate lighting that works brilliantly in black and white and the contrast between the silky hair and the roughness of the background is just fantastic. In a free study it would be an instant 10, but I''m just struggling with the abstract angle on the shot as it the very directness of the image that gives it it''s power. But ignore me and this challenge - for crying out loud just get this into a major exhibition, get it published, just get it out there where it deserves to be.', '2008-09-29 16:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980640, 725745, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract.', '2008-09-29 16:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980642, 726074, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and very nice processing. Not very abstract and not very emotional.</td>', 'Nice composition and very nice processing. Not very abstract and not very emotional.', '2008-09-29 16:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980647, 726025, 66384, '<td valign="top">Rather scary and nightmare-ish.</td>', 'Rather scary and nightmare-ish.', '2008-09-29 16:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980651, 725745, 71239, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I''ve been looking for colour and form to convey the emotion.  This absolutely nails it. Excellent use of texture, shape and colour so 10.</td>', 'In this challenge I''ve been looking for colour and form to convey the emotion.  This absolutely nails it. Excellent use of texture, shape and colour so 10.', '2008-09-29 16:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980654, 725228, 71239, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I''ve been looking for shape, colour and form to convey the emotion.<br/>One of only two 10s from me in this challenge.</td>', 'In this challenge I''ve been looking for shape, colour and form to convey the emotion.One of only two 10s from me in this challenge.', '2008-09-29 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980656, 725785, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image with lovely lighting, but not abstract.</td>', 'Nice clear image with lovely lighting, but not abstract.', '2008-09-29 16:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980657, 726072, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can see the joy, but there is something scary about the dark figure too. I think it is abstract, and emotional, so you met the challenge well.</td>', 'I can see the joy, but there is something scary about the dark figure too. I think it is abstract, and emotional, so you met the challenge well.', '2008-09-29 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980658, 725051, 71239, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very effective.  Clever colour choice/lighting to enhance the emotional impact and the idea of the heart as negative space makes the shot.  Also proves that having a clearly defined object is not a barrier in an abstract challenge. 9.</td>', 'Very simple, very effective.  Clever colour choice/lighting to enhance the emotional impact and the idea of the heart as negative space makes the shot.  Also proves that having a clearly defined object is not a barrier in an abstract challenge. 9.', '2008-09-29 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980661, 725988, 71239, '<td valign="top">Bonus marks for being about as abstract as they come!  It looks a bit like a PC power supply, in which case even more kudos for spotting the image in the mundane.</td>', 'Bonus marks for being about as abstract as they come!  It looks a bit like a PC power supply, in which case even more kudos for spotting the image in the mundane.', '2008-09-29 17:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980662, 725753, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this and feel the turbulence. While I recognize the rapids, I still think the image has a very abstract look.</td>', 'I really like this and feel the turbulence. While I recognize the rapids, I still think the image has a very abstract look.', '2008-09-29 17:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980664, 724360, 71239, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing a duck on water, but nicely post-processed to get the abstract quality.  Makes it look like a multi-coloured flame on a silk background.</td>', 'I''m guessing a duck on water, but nicely post-processed to get the abstract quality.  Makes it look like a multi-coloured flame on a silk background.', '2008-09-29 17:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980665, 725197, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great image. I love the subject and the processing. It seems more surreal than abstract, but I''ll expand my interpretation of the challenge here.</td>', 'Great image. I love the subject and the processing. It seems more surreal than abstract, but I''ll expand my interpretation of the challenge here.', '2008-09-29 17:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980666, 725868, 66384, '<td valign="top">I see pure love.</td>', 'I see pure love.', '2008-09-29 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980669, 723900, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love it -- great lines and colors. It is very abstract and gives me an excited and bright feeling.</td>', 'I love it -- great lines and colors. It is very abstract and gives me an excited and bright feeling.', '2008-09-29 17:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980674, 723900, 60910, '<td valign="top">awesome capture!</td>', 'awesome capture!', '2008-09-29 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980676, 726074, 60910, '<td valign="top">phenomenal tones, crop and comp.  wow, i must know your process for b/w images</td>', 'phenomenal tones, crop and comp.  wow, i must know your process for b/w images', '2008-09-29 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980679, 725983, 80096, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2008-09-29 17:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980685, 725823, 80096, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2008-09-29 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980686, 726085, 55956, '<td valign="top">just a 6 :)</td>', 'just a 6 :)', '2008-09-29 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980688, 725591, 80096, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2008-09-29 17:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980690, 725880, 55956, '<td valign="top">this remember me another shot :)</td>', 'this remember me another shot :)', '2008-09-29 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980692, 723788, 80096, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2008-09-29 17:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980695, 724865, 66384, '<td valign="top">Excellent representation of passion.</td>', 'Excellent representation of passion.', '2008-09-29 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980698, 726028, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. I like the colors and bokeh. It seems abstract, and the drop makes me feel a bit sad -- like a teardrop.</td>', 'Lovely image. I like the colors and bokeh. It seems abstract, and the drop makes me feel a bit sad -- like a teardrop.', '2008-09-29 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4980706, 725815, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Looks as though the colors are painted on. I don''t really feel the emotion in this, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Looks as though the colors are painted on. I don''t really feel the emotion in this, but I like it a lot.', '2008-09-29 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980711, 725823, 66384, '<td valign="top">It seems as though you made no effort to create an abstract image. That being said, it is a nice baby snapshot. I like the b&amp;w conversion. The background is busy and distracting.</td>', 'It seems as though you made no effort to create an abstract image. That being said, it is a nice baby snapshot. I like the b&w conversion. The background is busy and distracting.', '2008-09-29 17:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980716, 725619, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oooo, lovely. It is a very happy image.</td>', 'Oooo, lovely. It is a very happy image.', '2008-09-29 17:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980717, 725207, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot. The colors, the focus and composition, and the light. It clearly communicates a feeling of isolation. It''s not my idea of abstract, but I''ll be open-minded here.</td>', 'I like the image a lot. The colors, the focus and composition, and the light. It clearly communicates a feeling of isolation. It''s not my idea of abstract, but I''ll be open-minded here.', '2008-09-29 17:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980722, 725904, 66384, '<td valign="top">Has a light and happy feel. I like it.</td>', 'Has a light and happy feel. I like it.', '2008-09-29 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980729, 725887, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting -- I didn''t get a feel of love from this. I got a heavy feeling of apprehension. Still it is abstract, and evokes a strong emotion, so I''d say you met the challenge very well. I really like the image. 10</td>', 'Interesting -- I didn''t get a feel of love from this. I got a heavy feeling of apprehension. Still it is abstract, and evokes a strong emotion, so I''d say you met the challenge very well. I really like the image. 10', '2008-09-29 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980731, 724945, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like it. I think I would like it better without the noise. It gives me a feel of danger -- a whirling into a black hole. Or perhaps -- down the drain into nothingness.</td>', 'I like it. I think I would like it better without the noise. It gives me a feel of danger -- a whirling into a black hole. Or perhaps -- down the drain into nothingness.', '2008-09-29 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980734, 725579, 66384, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm, I like it. It''s delicious. Very joyful.</td>', 'Mmmmm, I like it. It''s delicious. Very joyful.', '2008-09-29 18:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980740, 725782, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a radiant and hopeful image. I see the image of the photographer, but that doesn''t seem to be the main focus of the image. There is the arc of a rainbow and the bright yellow of a sun with the radiant lines of a sunrise. I think this is a good abstract conveying emotion.</td>', 'This is a radiant and hopeful image. I see the image of the photographer, but that doesn''t seem to be the main focus of the image. There is the arc of a rainbow and the bright yellow of a sun with the radiant lines of a sunrise. I think this is a good abstract conveying emotion.', '2008-09-29 18:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980743, 725106, 66384, '<td valign="top">I feel a happy confusion from this image. It is very psychedelic. Nice colors.</td>', 'I feel a happy confusion from this image. It is very psychedelic. Nice colors.', '2008-09-29 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980749, 725591, 66384, '<td valign="top">I see the emotion, but not the abstract. That being said, it is a beautiful image.</td>', 'I see the emotion, but not the abstract. That being said, it is a beautiful image.', '2008-09-29 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980750, 725574, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely image with a happy and celebratory feel.</td>', 'Lovely image with a happy and celebratory feel.', '2008-09-29 18:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980753, 726086, 66384, '<td valign="top">The arc and the color give me a sunny feel of hope. I would like it better without the noise.</td>', 'The arc and the color give me a sunny feel of hope. I would like it better without the noise.', '2008-09-29 18:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980757, 725765, 66384, '<td valign="top">My top pick so far. Excellent!</td>', 'My top pick so far. Excellent!', '2008-09-29 18:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980772, 725242, 66384, '<td valign="top">Seems to restful for ''melancholy''. But it is a beautiful image. I love the color and design. I feel uplifted and calmed by this.</td>', 'Seems to restful for ''melancholy''. But it is a beautiful image. I love the color and design. I feel uplifted and calmed by this.', '2008-09-29 18:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980779, 725080, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for the abstract emotion, but then I am only one.</td>', 'This is my pick for the abstract emotion, but then I am only one.', '2008-09-29 18:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980782, 725064, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice. I recognize the koi, yet the image is very abstract in the colors and lines. I really like this, and it makes me feel happy and yet somewhat frenzied.</td>', 'Nice. I recognize the koi, yet the image is very abstract in the colors and lines. I really like this, and it makes me feel happy and yet somewhat frenzied.', '2008-09-29 18:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980808, 726059, 20577, '<td valign="top">Hello. I am writing today to comment on this photo. I think it is weird.</td>', 'Hello. I am writing today to comment on this photo. I think it is weird.', '2008-09-29 19:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980810, 725838, 20577, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize those boobs...</td>', 'I think I recognize those boobs...', '2008-09-29 19:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980814, 725985, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist look.</td>', 'I like the minimalist look.', '2008-09-29 19:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980821, 725219, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great shot, turmoil is exactly what I thought when I saw that flurry of movement.</td>', 'Great shot, turmoil is exactly what I thought when I saw that flurry of movement.', '2008-09-29 19:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980837, 726037, 32345, '<td valign="top">LOL, c''est super bon.... mais pas de vote de ma part ;)</td>', 'LOL, c''est super bon.... mais pas de vote de ma part ;)', '2008-09-29 19:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980848, 725969, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful, makes me feel sad, like the tree is bent over and crying.</td>', 'This is quite beautiful, makes me feel sad, like the tree is bent over and crying.', '2008-09-29 19:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980861, 725756, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best as far as I''m concerned. I know it''s a baseball game (it is, right?) but the swirl slant you''ve put on it really conveys those topsy turvy feelings of nervous anticipation and anxiety. I like also how one half of the picture is that soft bright green and the other is the mixed colours of the crowd. Awesome. Sorry for the essay, hehe.</td>', 'This is one of the best as far as I''m concerned. I know it''s a baseball game (it is, right?) but the swirl slant you''ve put on it really conveys those topsy turvy feelings of nervous anticipation and anxiety. I like also how one half of the picture is that soft bright green and the other is the mixed colours of the crowd. Awesome. Sorry for the essay, hehe.', '2008-09-29 20:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
