(4980954, 725295, 97936, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the very strong reflection in the eye, and the cropping doesn''t do anything for me.  I think it would have been more interesting if the eye were less centered, not cropped, cropped more, or left out completely.  I think the movement and texture in the feathering would make a stronger abstract image by itself and could still communicate an emotional quality.  I don''t think the eye, as it is here, adds anything.  It is a very cool subject, though, and the lines are very striking.</td>', 'I don''t like the very strong reflection in the eye, and the cropping doesn''t do anything for me.  I think it would have been more interesting if the eye were less centered, not cropped, cropped more, or left out completely.  I think the movement and texture in the feathering would make a stronger abstract image by itself and could still communicate an emotional quality.  I don''t think the eye, as it is here, adds anything.  It is a very cool subject, though, and the lines are very striking.', '2008-09-29 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4980955, 725229, 97936, '<td valign="top">I think I would like the heart to be slightly less vibrant so that my attention went more to the lips.</td>', 'I think I would like the heart to be slightly less vibrant so that my attention went more to the lips.', '2008-09-29 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
