(4981022, 725464, 97936, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting in a weirdly creepy sort of way, but I think it''s a brilliant use of motion.  I find the floating zipper pulls fairly distracting to the overall mood.</td>', 'This is really interesting in a weirdly creepy sort of way, but I think it''s a brilliant use of motion.  I find the floating zipper pulls fairly distracting to the overall mood.', '2008-09-29 22:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4981024, 726005, 97936, '<td valign="top">Not your typical cityscape.  I like it.</td>', 'Not your typical cityscape.  I like it.', '2008-09-29 22:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4981027, 725785, 97936, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, there''s too much going on in this image between all the reflections and the details of the place settings.  I think this would have been more interesting if you had created a more abstract image using just a couple of the pieces on the table.</td>', 'In my opinion, there''s too much going on in this image between all the reflections and the details of the place settings.  I think this would have been more interesting if you had created a more abstract image using just a couple of the pieces on the table.', '2008-09-29 22:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4981032, 724885, 97936, '<td valign="top">The colors and shapes here are definitely interesting, but I would have liked a little more definition, even in an abstract image, to make the capture feel more intentional.</td>', 'The colors and shapes here are definitely interesting, but I would have liked a little more definition, even in an abstract image, to make the capture feel more intentional.', '2008-09-29 22:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4981039, 725982, 97936, '<td valign="top">The very severe black and white here is extremely cold to me in a way that contradicts the intended message.</td>', 'The very severe black and white here is extremely cold to me in a way that contradicts the intended message.', '2008-09-29 22:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
