(4982461, 726016, 62187, '<td valign="top">Seize the day and I''ve seen a lot of ''carp'' photos in the newly uploaded photo pages and I imagine that''s what this is. It''s got abstractedness for sure but it doesn''t make me want to directly seize the day.</td>', 'Seize the day and I''ve seen a lot of ''carp'' photos in the newly uploaded photo pages and I imagine that''s what this is. It''s got abstractedness for sure but it doesn''t make me want to directly seize the day.', '2008-09-30 22:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
