(4982473, 726082, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm? It instantly made me feel cold. But, a very good entry - it''s the focus that bothers me: 8</td>', 'Hmmm? It instantly made me feel cold. But, a very good entry - it''s the focus that bothers me: 8', '2008-09-30 22:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982475, 725207, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is a 10 but is lost, for me, in it''s lack of pure abstractness. The focus is superb!</td>', 'The photo is a 10 but is lost, for me, in it''s lack of pure abstractness. The focus is superb!', '2008-09-30 22:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982478, 725985, 62187, '<td valign="top">You know what? The photo is horrible to me. But wait please: for the challenge it is absolutely perfect and beautiful. It is truly abstract and pure emotion. I''m hoping this one is in the top 10 but I''m afraid most people here are not here to think about what they are looking at or it''s a secondary issue at best. Good luck - I''m giving this photo a 10.</td>', 'You know what? The photo is horrible to me. But wait please: for the challenge it is absolutely perfect and beautiful. It is truly abstract and pure emotion. I''m hoping this one is in the top 10 but I''m afraid most people here are not here to think about what they are looking at or it''s a secondary issue at best. Good luck - I''m giving this photo a 10.', '2008-09-30 22:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982480, 725219, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very good at making a easily recognizable object, it''s obviously a submarine!, into something of a work of art and turning it into an abstract. Your title certainly helps to bring out the emotion. I think you''ve got a ribbon contender here: 10</td>', 'Very good at making a easily recognizable object, it''s obviously a submarine!, into something of a work of art and turning it into an abstract. Your title certainly helps to bring out the emotion. I think you''ve got a ribbon contender here: 10', '2008-09-30 22:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982483, 725997, 62187, '<td valign="top">OOOOOHHHH YESSSSSSS...!!! TEN</td>', 'OOOOOHHHH YESSSSSSS...!!! TEN', '2008-09-30 22:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982487, 726069, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m feelin'' it! Very good to me: 8</td>', 'I''m feelin'' it! Very good to me: 8', '2008-09-30 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
