(4982493, 723788, 62187, '<td valign="top">This is just me: for one...that napkin has got to go. For two...not very abstract...three, yes, I feel some emotion.</td>', 'This is just me: for one...that napkin has got to go. For two...not very abstract...three, yes, I feel some emotion.', '2008-09-30 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
