(4982499, 725776, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the grain, I think it helps the emotion of this. It''s not totally abstract to me but almost: 8</td>', 'I like the grain, I think it helps the emotion of this. It''s not totally abstract to me but almost: 8', '2008-09-30 22:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982503, 725842, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s not quite abstract. I can certainly tell what it is. And I''m not sure about your title - it''s not hitting on any emotion to me except maybe greed. I''m not sure. It is however a very excellent photo and I''m sure it will beat the socks off of many other obvious emotional photos in this challenge.</td>', 'For me, it''s not quite abstract. I can certainly tell what it is. And I''m not sure about your title - it''s not hitting on any emotion to me except maybe greed. I''m not sure. It is however a very excellent photo and I''m sure it will beat the socks off of many other obvious emotional photos in this challenge.', '2008-09-30 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982505, 725574, 62187, '<td valign="top">It almost works for me: hinting at both some abstractness and emotion.</td>', 'It almost works for me: hinting at both some abstractness and emotion.', '2008-09-30 22:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982509, 725951, 62187, '<td valign="top">This gum wall...<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=720245" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/916/120/720245.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/916/120/720245.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/916/120/720245.jpg"/></a>...? Yep, it''s abstract. Yep, it makes me feel emotion. People are gross and I hate when I recognize photos from other recent challenges. Regardless of my feelings, I''ll still rate it higher then my ''feelings'' tell me. 8</td>', 'This gum wall......? Yep, it''s abstract. Yep, it makes me feel emotion. People are gross and I hate when I recognize photos from other recent challenges. Regardless of my feelings, I''ll still rate it higher then my ''feelings'' tell me. 8', '2008-09-30 22:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982512, 726089, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s not very abstract to me and it may have emotional memories for you which is very sweet, but it''s not making me think or feel ''Young Love''. It makes me feel ''Heavy Hay Bales''!</td>', 'It''s not very abstract to me and it may have emotional memories for you which is very sweet, but it''s not making me think or feel ''Young Love''. It makes me feel ''Heavy Hay Bales''!', '2008-09-30 22:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
