(4982522, 725928, 62187, '<td valign="top">I would have scored your photo MUCH higher if you would have included her other sisters. Just kidding! Very good but I think people will be confused and not bother to understand what you are showing. Plus, the focus is off I think. On purpose?</td>', 'I would have scored your photo MUCH higher if you would have included her other sisters. Just kidding! Very good but I think people will be confused and not bother to understand what you are showing. Plus, the focus is off I think. On purpose?', '2008-09-30 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982523, 725815, 62187, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of Jimi Hendrix for some reason. The feather takes away the abstractedness to me. Otherwise, very good.</td>', 'It reminds me of Jimi Hendrix for some reason. The feather takes away the abstractedness to me. Otherwise, very good.', '2008-09-30 22:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982529, 726029, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, I looked up the meaning. For me, it''s a very good photo. But, I don''t think it needs the scalpel. I can''t speak for others and that''s because I think most people will not look the meaning up. I think you have twisted the true meaning of the word which for me, just makes it even better. I''m going with a 10.</td>', 'Well, I looked up the meaning. For me, it''s a very good photo. But, I don''t think it needs the scalpel. I can''t speak for others and that''s because I think most people will not look the meaning up. I think you have twisted the true meaning of the word which for me, just makes it even better. I''m going with a 10.', '2008-09-30 22:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982530, 725310, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not quite abstract but very close and very, very cool: 8</td>', 'Not quite abstract but very close and very, very cool: 8', '2008-09-30 22:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982532, 724919, 62187, '<td valign="top">Emotional: very. Abstract: not to me. The photo is excellent though.</td>', 'Emotional: very. Abstract: not to me. The photo is excellent though.', '2008-09-30 23:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982534, 724885, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and I hope your title means this: Fear that the photo will suck in the challenge and hope that others see it like you do. So, I feel your pain: 7</td>', 'Very abstract and I hope your title means this: Fear that the photo will suck in the challenge and hope that others see it like you do. So, I feel your pain: 7', '2008-09-30 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982535, 725242, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it would look better a bit brighter. But wait, then it wouldn''t be very Melancholy now would it? Very good! 8</td>', 'I think it would look better a bit brighter. But wait, then it wouldn''t be very Melancholy now would it? Very good! 8', '2008-09-30 23:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982536, 725887, 62187, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s some kind of twisted humor I''m not seeing. But, it''s abstract and yep, I got some emotion from it: 10</td>', 'Maybe it''s some kind of twisted humor I''m not seeing. But, it''s abstract and yep, I got some emotion from it: 10', '2008-09-30 23:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982541, 725991, 62187, '<td valign="top">Would you rather me scream or vote your photo a 10? That''s what I thought: 10</td>', 'Would you rather me scream or vote your photo a 10? That''s what I thought: 10', '2008-09-30 23:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4982543, 725924, 62187, '<td valign="top">Really? It made me feel I had some kind of germs. Oh...! Love germs huh!?!?!?! I''ll bite: 8</td>', 'Really? It made me feel I had some kind of germs. Oh...! Love germs huh!?!?!?! I''ll bite: 8', '2008-09-30 23:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
