(4982591, 724885, 48963, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract quality, although wishing for better focus. Trying to see fear and hope in there, but not connecting.</td>', 'I like the abstract quality, although wishing for better focus. Trying to see fear and hope in there, but not connecting.', '2008-09-30 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
