(4982595, 725745, 48963, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites because it''s well photographed, I have no idea what it is, plus it is evocative. Nice one.</td>', 'One of my favorites because it''s well photographed, I have no idea what it is, plus it is evocative. Nice one.', '2008-09-30 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
