(4984316, 726054, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hey, I recognize that peanut in the background...it''s me. I like your image and the off centeredness of the "couple." Well done &amp; good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey, I recognize that peanut in the background...it''s me. I like your image and the off centeredness of the "couple." Well done & good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-01 10:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
