(4984739, 725535, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how emotional this is but it does have a strong abstract feeling.</td>', 'I don''t know how emotional this is but it does have a strong abstract feeling.', '2008-10-01 13:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984758, 725745, 50695, '<td valign="top">A good emotional abstract will take on any number of emotions that are assigned to it. I see this now with the word "grief" underneath it, and it''s heartbreaking. I''m starting to think there are schools of emotion. Like this image could go with peace, serenity, understanding as well as sorrow, love, or grief. The abstracts I see for "joy" could go with agitation, excitement, love, intensity, maybe even war.</td>', 'A good emotional abstract will take on any number of emotions that are assigned to it. I see this now with the word "grief" underneath it, and it''s heartbreaking. I''m starting to think there are schools of emotion. Like this image could go with peace, serenity, understanding as well as sorrow, love, or grief. The abstracts I see for "joy" could go with agitation, excitement, love, intensity, maybe even war.', '2008-10-01 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
