(4986719, 725551, 58457, '<td valign="top">i think there is strong emotion in this photo... however it could maybe use a bit better composition... I feel like the pole in the center carries a bit too much visual weight--maybe if you had shot it just a bit right of the pole...hmmmm...</td>', 'i think there is strong emotion in this photo... however it could maybe use a bit better composition... I feel like the pole in the center carries a bit too much visual weight--maybe if you had shot it just a bit right of the pole...hmmmm...', '2008-10-02 10:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
