(4987031, 725842, 98576, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2008-10-02 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987155, 726081, 39558, '<td valign="top">What an awesome find!<br/>You can''t stage a photo like this one. I hope voters realize that.<br/>Good job!<br/> <br/>Your tomato depicts such boldness. <br/>It Shows a true willingness to survive no matter what the surroundings are.<br/>Undoubtedly its an extremely lonesome life growing up in a less desirable setting. Shunned by other tomatoes I''m sure.<br/>This tomato has risen up through a crack in the road. Kind of like it''s saying Im an outcast and so what? Who wants to be like everyone else any way?" <br/> <br/>Take most humans for example. We would demand that our life is to be strategically placed in a setting only where we are able to grow and live among a cluster of a hundred other tomatoes. You know, living on some plush urban penthouse vine and always looking to win the blue ribbon, hoping and striving to be in People Magazine.<br/>Your tomato humbly states "I am content." <br/>WOW!!! Your tomato says so much!!!!</td>', 'What an awesome find!You can''t stage a photo like this one. I hope voters realize that.Good job! Your tomato depicts such boldness. It Shows a true willingness to survive no matter what the surroundings are.Undoubtedly its an extremely lonesome life growing up in a less desirable setting. Shunned by other tomatoes I''m sure.This tomato has risen up through a crack in the road. Kind of like it''s saying Im an outcast and so what? Who wants to be like everyone else any way?"  Take most humans for example. We would demand that our life is to be strategically placed in a setting only where we are able to grow and live among a cluster of a hundred other tomatoes. You know, living on some plush urban penthouse vine and always looking to win the blue ribbon, hoping and striving to be in People Magazine.Your tomato humbly states "I am content." WOW!!! Your tomato says so much!!!!', '2008-10-02 13:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987182, 725260, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, it''s partially abstract and your title adds the amount of emotion needed to understand your photo''s message. Absolutely nothing wrong with the photo - it''s very good and the edit too.</td>', 'To me, it''s partially abstract and your title adds the amount of emotion needed to understand your photo''s message. Absolutely nothing wrong with the photo - it''s very good and the edit too.', '2008-10-02 14:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987192, 724360, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve taken an easily recognizable object and turned it into a very abstract image. I think the focus is slightly off or smoothed a bit to much but the colors are fantastic. I guess the red adds passion to the emotional side of the challenge...</td>', 'I think you''ve taken an easily recognizable object and turned it into a very abstract image. I think the focus is slightly off or smoothed a bit to much but the colors are fantastic. I guess the red adds passion to the emotional side of the challenge...', '2008-10-02 14:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987199, 725427, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think it''s literal rather then radical but regardless: very abstract. I think a tighter crop would have improved the overall effect. The focus seems a little soft</td>', 'I think it''s literal rather then radical but regardless: very abstract. I think a tighter crop would have improved the overall effect. The focus seems a little soft', '2008-10-02 14:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987207, 725904, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s very abstract and I like the contrasting pastel colors. The title doesn''t make sense to me nor does it help feel emotion. The photo does that on it''s own - rare for this challenge. Nice job...8</td>', 'It''s very abstract and I like the contrasting pastel colors. The title doesn''t make sense to me nor does it help feel emotion. The photo does that on it''s own - rare for this challenge. Nice job...8', '2008-10-02 14:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987209, 725252, 62187, '<td valign="top">Pretty good abstract with such a large object! Excellent focus too...</td>', 'Pretty good abstract with such a large object! Excellent focus too...', '2008-10-02 14:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987217, 725720, 62187, '<td valign="top">Seems like a very large object. If so, then nice job as I think finding abstractness in large objects is somewhat difficult. I''m seeing some grain that I''m not sure if it helps or hurts - it''s just there.</td>', 'Seems like a very large object. If so, then nice job as I think finding abstractness in large objects is somewhat difficult. I''m seeing some grain that I''m not sure if it helps or hurts - it''s just there.', '2008-10-02 14:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987223, 725415, 62187, '<td valign="top">A pretty cool effect - reminds me of the anti-voodoo doll for some reason and I have no idea what an anti-voodoo doll is. I just made it up. For me, there is more emotion to the photo then abstractedness but a good job at trying...</td>', 'A pretty cool effect - reminds me of the anti-voodoo doll for some reason and I have no idea what an anti-voodoo doll is. I just made it up. For me, there is more emotion to the photo then abstractedness but a good job at trying...', '2008-10-02 14:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987228, 725996, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, the abstractness is almost lost. However, your photo holds a lot of emotion. I think a lot of it relies on the title but that seems par for the course for this challenge.</td>', 'For me, the abstractness is almost lost. However, your photo holds a lot of emotion. I think a lot of it relies on the title but that seems par for the course for this challenge.', '2008-10-02 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987239, 724015, 62187, '<td valign="top">What? I don''t understand what you are trying to say. What state of mind are you in. Maybe I should stand in your shoes for a moment then I will get it. I''m changing my score from 6 to 10 - excellent for the challenge. I hope others look up the meaning of the word.</td>', 'What? I don''t understand what you are trying to say. What state of mind are you in. Maybe I should stand in your shoes for a moment then I will get it. I''m changing my score from 6 to 10 - excellent for the challenge. I hope others look up the meaning of the word.', '2008-10-02 14:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987254, 725400, 62187, '<td valign="top">At first, it did not make sense and I scored it a 6. I felt it was rather boring, not quite abstract and somewhat emotional. Then, like a good dpc''er should be - I looked up what I did not understand.<br/> <br/><a href="//en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ennui" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Wikipedia - Ennui</a> <br/> <br/>Now, I totally understand and think your photo is worthy of a 10. Good luck to you and take care...</td>', 'At first, it did not make sense and I scored it a 6. I felt it was rather boring, not quite abstract and somewhat emotional. Then, like a good dpc''er should be - I looked up what I did not understand. Wikipedia - Ennui  Now, I totally understand and think your photo is worthy of a 10. Good luck to you and take care...', '2008-10-02 14:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987262, 723900, 62187, '<td valign="top">Good job at giving an easily recognizable object and abstract feeling: 8</td>', 'Good job at giving an easily recognizable object and abstract feeling: 8', '2008-10-02 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987270, 724654, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, to me, it''s not abstract. I think a tighter crop would have achieved that better. For the emotion part - well, I think that part of the challenge was the most difficult and relies on the photos title to bring that quality out. So, I really love your edit process - it''s not a bad photo at all and I kind of like it.</td>', 'Well, to me, it''s not abstract. I think a tighter crop would have achieved that better. For the emotion part - well, I think that part of the challenge was the most difficult and relies on the photos title to bring that quality out. So, I really love your edit process - it''s not a bad photo at all and I kind of like it.', '2008-10-02 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987451, 725909, 99173, '<td valign="top">too grainy and not very intresting</td>', 'too grainy and not very intresting', '2008-10-02 16:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987465, 724015, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice colors - like to have seen a little more clarity/crispness at the fore.  Like your title and I think this image conveys a sense of it - <i>maybe</i> a little more context in this instance... maybe.  Up from 5.</td>', '6 - Nice colors - like to have seen a little more clarity/crispness at the fore.  Like your title and I think this image conveys a sense of it - maybe a little more context in this instance... maybe.  Up from 5.', '2008-10-02 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987554, 725756, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see the anxiety.</td>', 'I can definitely see the anxiety.', '2008-10-02 16:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987557, 725106, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very abstract - not a favorite edit of mine but the style looks like it could be fun to try...</td>', 'Very abstract - not a favorite edit of mine but the style looks like it could be fun to try...', '2008-10-02 16:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987560, 725753, 62187, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail version of this photo looks very abstract. In a way, so does the large version. It''s cheese right? Just kidding...of course I can see it''s a girl talking to her mother. Ok, I''m kidding again. The emotion I feel more then serenity is motion...the crop is cool as the darkness almost reflects the lighter side.</td>', 'The thumbnail version of this photo looks very abstract. In a way, so does the large version. It''s cheese right? Just kidding...of course I can see it''s a girl talking to her mother. Ok, I''m kidding again. The emotion I feel more then serenity is motion...the crop is cool as the darkness almost reflects the lighter side.', '2008-10-02 16:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987566, 726028, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can kinda see your intent. I like the colors but I always thought of acid rain as something yellow - it''s not a big deal. It certainly has a ''dead'' look which I think whatever color acid rain is, would bring.</td>', 'I can kinda see your intent. I like the colors but I always thought of acid rain as something yellow - it''s not a big deal. It certainly has a ''dead'' look which I think whatever color acid rain is, would bring.', '2008-10-02 16:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987569, 725865, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think if the focus were a little more crisp I would have voted your photo higher - the idea is very good.</td>', 'I think if the focus were a little more crisp I would have voted your photo higher - the idea is very good.', '2008-10-02 16:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987572, 725952, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s not a true abstract but is enough of one to overlook the obvious. The title adds to the emotional part in a good way. I think for this challenge, titles were important.</td>', 'For me, it''s not a true abstract but is enough of one to overlook the obvious. The title adds to the emotional part in a good way. I think for this challenge, titles were important.', '2008-10-02 16:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987573, 725312, 62187, '<td valign="top">A very cool, absolutely perfectly focused photo: just not very abstract to me.</td>', 'A very cool, absolutely perfectly focused photo: just not very abstract to me.', '2008-10-02 16:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987577, 725838, 62187, '<td valign="top">The ''Frustration'' for me is that the photo is not as abstract as I was thinking the challenge was calling for. It''s got emotion for sure...</td>', 'The ''Frustration'' for me is that the photo is not as abstract as I was thinking the challenge was calling for. It''s got emotion for sure...', '2008-10-02 16:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
