(4987584, 725867, 62187, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the ''Hippy'' era. Not a fan of the colors but that''s not how I judge a photo. It looks pretty much abstract to me and I guess it provides emotion by reminding me of a time in history.</td>', 'Reminds me of the ''Hippy'' era. Not a fan of the colors but that''s not how I judge a photo. It looks pretty much abstract to me and I guess it provides emotion by reminding me of a time in history.', '2008-10-02 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987586, 725531, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, one of the more emotional photos but is lacking in the abstractness I was thinking the challenge called for...</td>', 'To me, one of the more emotional photos but is lacking in the abstractness I was thinking the challenge called for...', '2008-10-02 17:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987588, 725579, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and has emotion. Admittedly, not a favorite of mine but I think it fits the challenge very well: 8</td>', 'Very abstract and has emotion. Admittedly, not a favorite of mine but I think it fits the challenge very well: 8', '2008-10-02 17:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987592, 725064, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think I saw another photo of what I thought were carp. I like this better but just not as abstract as I was hoping for. And for the ''Harmony'' part - it seems rather chaotic to me. I do like the photo - I''m just not sure it''s what I was hoping to find in this challenge. It looks like a painting which is cool to me.</td>', 'I think I saw another photo of what I thought were carp. I like this better but just not as abstract as I was hoping for. And for the ''Harmony'' part - it seems rather chaotic to me. I do like the photo - I''m just not sure it''s what I was hoping to find in this challenge. It looks like a painting which is cool to me.', '2008-10-02 17:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987595, 725229, 62187, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo. This is my second time around looking at it and I see now somebody asked for validation and you''ve passed. That''s great! (It wasn''t me: I NEVER ask even if it''s a clear violation. Anyway...) There is lot''s of emotion in the photo to me, it is however, lacking in the abstractedness I was hoping to find as well in this challenge. I''ll bet it does well anyway as it is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'A very nice photo. This is my second time around looking at it and I see now somebody asked for validation and you''ve passed. That''s great! (It wasn''t me: I NEVER ask even if it''s a clear violation. Anyway...) There is lot''s of emotion in the photo to me, it is however, lacking in the abstractedness I was hoping to find as well in this challenge. I''ll bet it does well anyway as it is very pleasing to the eye.', '2008-10-02 17:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987599, 726054, 62187, '<td valign="top">That out-of-focus guy really looks like he got rejected. 10 for the emotion but I''m not seeing much abstractedness.</td>', 'That out-of-focus guy really looks like he got rejected. 10 for the emotion but I''m not seeing much abstractedness.', '2008-10-02 17:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987601, 724951, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very emotional, not totally abstract: to me.</td>', 'Very emotional, not totally abstract: to me.', '2008-10-02 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987606, 725618, 62187, '<td valign="top">Your photo, on it''s own, is a perfect 10. For this challenge, to me, it''s not. The emotion is there and your title helps feel that but the abstractedness is not abstract enough as I see it. It is a GREAT photo though!</td>', 'Your photo, on it''s own, is a perfect 10. For this challenge, to me, it''s not. The emotion is there and your title helps feel that but the abstractedness is not abstract enough as I see it. It is a GREAT photo though!', '2008-10-02 17:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987608, 724944, 62187, '<td valign="top">Has a degree of abstractedness and the emotion I feel is confusion.</td>', 'Has a degree of abstractedness and the emotion I feel is confusion.', '2008-10-02 17:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987610, 725905, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, there is a lot of abstractedness in the photo: scattered around all over the place. I see ''motion'' but not ''Emotion''. The emotion I do feel is ''Fire Hazard! };&gt;)</td>', 'To me, there is a lot of abstractedness in the photo: scattered around all over the place. I see ''motion'' but not ''Emotion''. The emotion I do feel is ''Fire Hazard! };>)', '2008-10-02 17:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987615, 724865, 62187, '<td valign="top">Somewhat abstract to me. I''m not feeling too much ''Passion''. I''m getting a lot of grain and think the photo might be improved without it.</td>', 'Somewhat abstract to me. I''m not feeling too much ''Passion''. I''m getting a lot of grain and think the photo might be improved without it.', '2008-10-02 17:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
