(4987679, 725896, 62187, '<td valign="top">... if I dare...what? Give your photo a 10? No, I don''t think that''s what you''re saying. To me, there is an element of emotion but the abstract part is too clear.</td>', '... if I dare...what? Give your photo a 10? No, I don''t think that''s what you''re saying. To me, there is an element of emotion but the abstract part is too clear.', '2008-10-02 17:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
