(4987699, 725553, 66201, '<td valign="top">Hmmm- I like the image (and am still undecided as to how DPC voters take to PS Artistic Filters) - but I am not sure it conveys "panic"...autumn to me is more of a "going to sleep" or shutting down...but that''s personal.</td>', 'Hmmm- I like the image (and am still undecided as to how DPC voters take to PS Artistic Filters) - but I am not sure it conveys "panic"...autumn to me is more of a "going to sleep" or shutting down...but that''s personal.', '2008-10-02 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987700, 725903, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very fitting in these days and times.</td>', 'Very fitting in these days and times.', '2008-10-02 17:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
