(4987715, 724943, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t love it or hate it: I don''t understand it. I guess that could account for the emotional part but I think there is no abstractness whatsoever in the photo.</td>', 'I don''t love it or hate it: I don''t understand it. I guess that could account for the emotional part but I think there is no abstractness whatsoever in the photo.', '2008-10-02 17:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
