(4987719, 725080, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can feel your emotion but am not sold on the abstract side. Excellent focus or edit: or both!?!?!?!</td>', 'I can feel your emotion but am not sold on the abstract side. Excellent focus or edit: or both!?!?!?!', '2008-10-02 17:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987720, 725969, 62187, '<td valign="top">I totally feel the emotion.</td>', 'I totally feel the emotion.', '2008-10-02 17:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987730, 725553, 62187, '<td valign="top">Don''t panic...stop and pause for a second. Take a deep breath, in through your nose...hold it...hold it...ok, let it out...slowly, though your mouth...like you''re blowing out a candle. Ok? Ok...let''s do it again. There, don''t you feel better. See, the emotion is there. Just not as abstract as I was hoping to see in this challenge. Really? The leaves are changing where you live? Must be nice. I''m looking at 96 and it''s not even 2 in the afternoon yet!</td>', 'Don''t panic...stop and pause for a second. Take a deep breath, in through your nose...hold it...hold it...ok, let it out...slowly, though your mouth...like you''re blowing out a candle. Ok? Ok...let''s do it again. There, don''t you feel better. See, the emotion is there. Just not as abstract as I was hoping to see in this challenge. Really? The leaves are changing where you live? Must be nice. I''m looking at 96 and it''s not even 2 in the afternoon yet!', '2008-10-02 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987732, 725922, 62187, '<td valign="top">I love life just as much as the next person. The emotion is there but I''m missing out on the abstract part. I don''t think the out-of-focus look makes something abstract.</td>', 'I love life just as much as the next person. The emotion is there but I''m missing out on the abstract part. I don''t think the out-of-focus look makes something abstract.', '2008-10-02 17:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987734, 725868, 66201, '<td valign="top">I am loving this image SO much - but I feel you''ve sold yourself short by not giving a sublime title... this is almost a cop-out title as if you didn''t quite know what to do with the picture and leaves us with the feeling that perhaps you weren''t sure what you wanted to achieve by taking this shot...an accidental, incidental image. However when I look closely at it, I feel that you really did care a lot about this and that you did take quite a bit of time in presenting this image.SO, a 9 from me.</td>', 'I am loving this image SO much - but I feel you''ve sold yourself short by not giving a sublime title... this is almost a cop-out title as if you didn''t quite know what to do with the picture and leaves us with the feeling that perhaps you weren''t sure what you wanted to achieve by taking this shot...an accidental, incidental image. However when I look closely at it, I feel that you really did care a lot about this and that you did take quite a bit of time in presenting this image.SO, a 9 from me.', '2008-10-02 17:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987735, 725371, 62187, '<td valign="top">Elements of emotion are present and so is a touch of abstractness.</td>', 'Elements of emotion are present and so is a touch of abstractness.', '2008-10-02 17:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
