(4989826, 725106, 83313, '<td valign="top">Definitely very abstract. Oversaturated smoke trails maybe? If you were trying to convey "confusion", you nailed it.</td>', 'Definitely very abstract. Oversaturated smoke trails maybe? If you were trying to convey "confusion", you nailed it.', '2008-10-03 14:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
