(4989864, 725534, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is interesting, or just weird looking, but it made me stop and examine it for a few moments, so it deserves a good vote for making me stop. I think this one is teetering on the fine line between photography and digital art.</td>', 'Not sure if this is interesting, or just weird looking, but it made me stop and examine it for a few moments, so it deserves a good vote for making me stop. I think this one is teetering on the fine line between photography and digital art.', '2008-10-03 14:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
