(4990349, 726072, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful, and just a hint of a story under all that paper. Fantastic shot. I''m giving this a Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is so beautiful, and just a hint of a story under all that paper. Fantastic shot. I''m giving this a Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2008-10-03 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990351, 725219, 50695, '<td valign="top">strange, thrilling, disturbing, abstract and very emotional.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'strange, thrilling, disturbing, abstract and very emotional. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2008-10-03 19:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990356, 725294, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I find this particularly emotional. Kind of a sorrowful longing, but not melancholy, too wise to be melancholy, wise enough to know that life goes on.... after the rain.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Gorgeous. I find this particularly emotional. Kind of a sorrowful longing, but not melancholy, too wise to be melancholy, wise enough to know that life goes on.... after the rain. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2008-10-03 19:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990357, 725905, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful integration of artist with art.</td>', 'Beautiful integration of artist with art.', '2008-10-03 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990358, 726081, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''re probably getting killed but imho this is a brilliant execution of the challenge. The title might be confusing people, because this photo works not as a photo of a tomato but as an abstract composition. The feeling comes perhaps from the juxtaposition of the red circle and the dark circle below it.</td>', 'You''re probably getting killed but imho this is a brilliant execution of the challenge. The title might be confusing people, because this photo works not as a photo of a tomato but as an abstract composition. The feeling comes perhaps from the juxtaposition of the red circle and the dark circle below it.', '2008-10-03 19:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990359, 726080, 50695, '<td valign="top">Is this cutout? Fantastic.</td>', 'Is this cutout? Fantastic.', '2008-10-03 19:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990360, 726084, 50695, '<td valign="top">excellent. definitely evokes the emotion, the way it flies all over the place, out of control.</td>', 'excellent. definitely evokes the emotion, the way it flies all over the place, out of control.', '2008-10-03 19:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990361, 725579, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2008-10-03 19:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990362, 725867, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful and intriguing image.</td>', 'beautiful and intriguing image.', '2008-10-03 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990363, 725276, 50695, '<td valign="top">My, what beautiful bokeh you have... stunning photo. bright and scary at the same time. well done.</td>', 'My, what beautiful bokeh you have... stunning photo. bright and scary at the same time. well done.', '2008-10-03 19:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990364, 725904, 50695, '<td valign="top">I make my body art.<br/>I make my body lines<br/>and fine French words.<br/>I make my body lives<br/>and terrible deaths.<br/>I make my body not a body<br/>but a story.<br/> <br/>My body is not me.<br/>My body speaks<br/>but I am silent to you<br/>and my heart<br/>is in the dressing room.</td>', 'I make my body art.I make my body linesand fine French words.I make my body livesand terrible deaths.I make my body not a bodybut a story. My body is not me.My body speaksbut I am silent to youand my heartis in the dressing room.', '2008-10-03 19:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990365, 724875, 50695, '<td valign="top">brilliant. technically, this achieves emotion through symbolism, but at the same time you brought out the symbolism from an abstract pattern, and besides, it''s really really well done.</td>', 'brilliant. technically, this achieves emotion through symbolism, but at the same time you brought out the symbolism from an abstract pattern, and besides, it''s really really well done.', '2008-10-03 19:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990366, 726082, 50695, '<td valign="top">Faces almost forming give one a sense of ... unease. Well done.</td>', 'Faces almost forming give one a sense of ... unease. Well done.', '2008-10-03 19:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990368, 725978, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, a lyric elegance, a lyric energy.</td>', 'Yes, a lyric elegance, a lyric energy.', '2008-10-03 19:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990369, 726030, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the high contrast dissolves this into an abstract composition of dark shapes, jagged shapes appropriate to the title.</td>', 'I like how the high contrast dissolves this into an abstract composition of dark shapes, jagged shapes appropriate to the title.', '2008-10-03 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990371, 725776, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, the spookiness (emotion=fear) comes through the abstract composition even without knowing the subject.</td>', 'Yes, the spookiness (emotion=fear) comes through the abstract composition even without knowing the subject.', '2008-10-03 19:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990372, 724919, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is more abstract than voters are probably giving you credit for. I think the emotion comes from the abstract composition of lights and darks as much as from the subject matter. In fact, who''s to even say any of it comes from the subject matter? We don''t know how he''s feeling. Well done.</td>', 'This is more abstract than voters are probably giving you credit for. I think the emotion comes from the abstract composition of lights and darks as much as from the subject matter. In fact, who''s to even say any of it comes from the subject matter? We don''t know how he''s feeling. Well done.', '2008-10-03 19:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990373, 724360, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good job of processing this out of duck and into emotion. Well done.</td>', 'Good job of processing this out of duck and into emotion. Well done.', '2008-10-03 19:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990374, 725544, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lovely and bluesy. Good fulfillment of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely and bluesy. Good fulfillment of the challenge.', '2008-10-03 19:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990377, 725991, 50695, '<td valign="top">This dissolves into and out of abstraction, and the process is truly disturbing. Well done.</td>', 'This dissolves into and out of abstraction, and the process is truly disturbing. Well done.', '2008-10-03 19:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990378, 726012, 50695, '<td valign="top">a little sad, a lot serene, all over lovely.</td>', 'a little sad, a lot serene, all over lovely.', '2008-10-03 19:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990381, 726020, 50695, '<td valign="top">yes, the abstract quality of the photo gives a sense of isolation between pieces. This is perhaps the most memorable picture in the challenge, without taking the challenge itself into consideration.</td>', 'yes, the abstract quality of the photo gives a sense of isolation between pieces. This is perhaps the most memorable picture in the challenge, without taking the challenge itself into consideration.', '2008-10-03 19:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990382, 726016, 50695, '<td valign="top">The bright colors do evoke emotion, perhaps something a little dizzier and scarier than carpe diem, although siezing the day can be both of those things. Good job.</td>', 'The bright colors do evoke emotion, perhaps something a little dizzier and scarier than carpe diem, although siezing the day can be both of those things. Good job.', '2008-10-03 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990383, 725924, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the isolated heart blobs. It makes the title feel a little sardonic. The photo is lonelier than the title might care to admit.</td>', 'I like the isolated heart blobs. It makes the title feel a little sardonic. The photo is lonelier than the title might care to admit.', '2008-10-03 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990384, 725969, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes there is a sigh in this.</td>', 'Yes there is a sigh in this.', '2008-10-03 19:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990388, 725720, 50695, '<td valign="top">bold and yes, emotional, abstract.</td>', 'bold and yes, emotional, abstract.', '2008-10-03 19:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990389, 726014, 50695, '<td valign="top">too much dependent on face symbolism for me to go over 7, but I''ll give you a 7 for a terrific photo.</td>', 'too much dependent on face symbolism for me to go over 7, but I''ll give you a 7 for a terrific photo.', '2008-10-03 19:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990469, 725728, 91197, '<td valign="top">Except from the nail a good one! 9 for the smiling eyes!</td>', 'Except from the nail a good one! 9 for the smiling eyes!', '2008-10-03 20:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4990533, 725973, 50695, '<td valign="top">this uses story elements to convey emotions, so it''s not completely abstract, though it certainly suggests abstractness... so I''ll give you a 7 just because it''s a damn good picture.</td>', 'this uses story elements to convey emotions, so it''s not completely abstract, though it certainly suggests abstractness... so I''ll give you a 7 just because it''s a damn good picture.', '2008-10-03 20:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
