(4990684, 725753, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is a lovely abstract and emotive, and you get above average marks from me for it, but I must admit the emotion it generates (for me) is the opposite of serenity.  Curious to see, hopefully in your notes, how you see serenity in it.</td>', 'I think this is a lovely abstract and emotive, and you get above average marks from me for it, but I must admit the emotion it generates (for me) is the opposite of serenity.  Curious to see, hopefully in your notes, how you see serenity in it.', '2008-10-03 22:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
