(4990923, 725591, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great image, clear, good color and unique composition in the placement of the horizon. The tree has an unfortunate halo. It is not abstract, in fact, it''s quite concrete! Nice capture.</td>', 'Great image, clear, good color and unique composition in the placement of the horizon. The tree has an unfortunate halo. It is not abstract, in fact, it''s quite concrete! Nice capture.', '2008-10-04 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
