(4990928, 725996, 54645, '<td valign="top">I believe I recognize this mug! Powerful image, well done. The smoke, however, does not look like it''s actually coming out of his mouth. Don''t know if it is or is not. Still top 10 for me.</td>', 'I believe I recognize this mug! Powerful image, well done. The smoke, however, does not look like it''s actually coming out of his mouth. Don''t know if it is or is not. Still top 10 for me.', '2008-10-04 02:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
