(4992160, 726021, 82985, '<td valign="top">well done concept for this challenge. keeping the focus on the eye/eyelash is well done. I find the lighting to be a bit bright/harsh.  not sure if this is a grab shot or a set up where you might have options.  playing a bit with the highlights (bringing them down a bit) and maybe a slightly richer tonality (perhaps even a sepia, b/w, or duotone?) might align to the mood a bit more.  This is a nit, but the numerous specular highlights on the mesh seem distracting to me--but I am not sure I would have the patience to go and spot all of those down to black/gray...  of course, feel free to disregard all of my comments--you still get a 7 from me</td>', 'well done concept for this challenge. keeping the focus on the eye/eyelash is well done. I find the lighting to be a bit bright/harsh.  not sure if this is a grab shot or a set up where you might have options.  playing a bit with the highlights (bringing them down a bit) and maybe a slightly richer tonality (perhaps even a sepia, b/w, or duotone?) might align to the mood a bit more.  This is a nit, but the numerous specular highlights on the mesh seem distracting to me--but I am not sure I would have the patience to go and spot all of those down to black/gray...  of course, feel free to disregard all of my comments--you still get a 7 from me', '2008-10-05 00:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4992162, 724884, 82985, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  the little white triangle between his thigh and torso might warrant a clone-out  7</td>', 'I really like this!  the little white triangle between his thigh and torso might warrant a clone-out  7', '2008-10-05 00:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
