(4994283, 725782, 16046, '<td valign="top">Deserves a much higher score, very nice</td>', 'Deserves a much higher score, very nice', '2008-10-06 02:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4994287, 726074, 50641, '<td valign="top">congrats - but i think you could have had it all, abstract, photographic, water drops... if youda just cropped a bit ;-)  hmm, i gotta get your tritone recipe one of these days....</td>', 'congrats - but i think you could have had it all, abstract, photographic, water drops... if youda just cropped a bit ;-)  hmm, i gotta get your tritone recipe one of these days....', '2008-10-06 02:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4994298, 725228, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is very beautifully done - delicate hand with your twist and zoom. The vortices convey what I imagine to be the chakral energies. Congratulations on an excellent personal best.</td>', 'This is very beautifully done - delicate hand with your twist and zoom. The vortices convey what I imagine to be the chakral energies. Congratulations on an excellent personal best.', '2008-10-06 03:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4994306, 726074, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> congrats - but i think you could have had it all, abstract, photographic, water drops... if youda just cropped a bit ;-)  hmm, i gotta get your tritone recipe one of these days.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought about stacking everything in one spot so that the knife was underneath the onion and it looked like it was all one jumbled mess. The water would be splashed on the outside of it like it was poured/dropped from a distance a la Jackson Polack but forgot to shoot that version <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-06 02:13:14.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: congrats - but i think you could have had it all, abstract, photographic, water drops... if youda just cropped a bit ;-)  hmm, i gotta get your tritone recipe one of these days....   I thought about stacking everything in one spot so that the knife was underneath the onion and it looked like it was all one jumbled mess. The water would be splashed on the outside of it like it was poured/dropped from a distance a la Jackson Polack but forgot to shoot that version ', '2008-10-06 03:11:04.000000', '2008-10-06 03:13:14.000000', 0),
(4994311, 725765, 13958, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the great support of my entry. I must admit, I expected, or better hoped, to get to 6.5 with this, but that this is enough for a red ribbon, what a bonus. <br/> <br/>The shot itself is actually very simple.<br/> <br/>An orange pantyhose over my wife''s face and a big scream. Crop to what looks best and maybe some more contrast. That''s all.<br/> <br/>I intend to re-shoot this pic shortly, but this time with the eyes panic-stricken open. Only thought of this during the voting period.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the great support of my entry. I must admit, I expected, or better hoped, to get to 6.5 with this, but that this is enough for a red ribbon, what a bonus.  The shot itself is actually very simple. An orange pantyhose over my wife''s face and a big scream. Crop to what looks best and maybe some more contrast. That''s all. I intend to re-shoot this pic shortly, but this time with the eyes panic-stricken open. Only thought of this during the voting period. ', '2008-10-06 03:14:58.000000', NULL, 0),
