(4995242, 726074, 30982, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what you said there in the "processing steps" - I just know it has that wonderful patented (or should be) Yanko toning to it.  Toning to die for, I might add.  Very good tip, though, on turning "day to night" - will have to play with that to see if I can get anywhere close.  First I need to shoot something properly exposed and focused, THEN I''ll try.  Very nice work.  And I LOVE that red/blue abstract, by the way.</td>', 'I have no idea what you said there in the "processing steps" - I just know it has that wonderful patented (or should be) Yanko toning to it.  Toning to die for, I might add.  Very good tip, though, on turning "day to night" - will have to play with that to see if I can get anywhere close.  First I need to shoot something properly exposed and focused, THEN I''ll try.  Very nice work.  And I LOVE that red/blue abstract, by the way.', '2008-10-06 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
