(4996912, 725880, 68586, '<td valign="top">Hey Deb - I''ve just noticed this !<br/> <br/>Lovely shot full of movement colour and energy, and certainly very ''melethial''  :- )<br/> <br/>It would have been nice to capture your thoughts on the rushing about / life being hectic and put it into a title to help people share what your thoughts were when you captured this and give this shot that little extra depth that it so richly deserves.<br/> <br/> Very nice shot.</td>', 'Hey Deb - I''ve just noticed this ! Lovely shot full of movement colour and energy, and certainly very ''melethial''  :- ) It would have been nice to capture your thoughts on the rushing about / life being hectic and put it into a title to help people share what your thoughts were when you captured this and give this shot that little extra depth that it so richly deserves.  Very nice shot.', '2008-10-07 14:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
