(5000258, 726074, 19671, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice to have you explain the steps that you used to create the look.</td>', 'Would have been nice to have you explain the steps that you used to create the look.', '2008-10-08 18:22:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5001683, 724945, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great colors &amp; texture. Looks like a worm hole to me. Or maybe just the inside of a trumpet bell :-). Anyway, I think it''s a great shot that should have scored higher.</td>', 'Great colors & texture. Looks like a worm hole to me. Or maybe just the inside of a trumpet bell :-). Anyway, I think it''s a great shot that should have scored higher.', '2008-10-09 14:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5001792, 725756, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hello Jeffrey... comment is per the critique club.<br/> <br/>Really not too much to say. The execution and relevance to the challenge is spot on. The square format is perfect as it emphasizes the middle and really anyone wanting to understand when to use the square format should look here. The zoom effect and rotation really adds zip to the photo and gives it an exciting energy. Emotions are subjective to say the least, and I think anxiety is a good choice here. <br/> <br/>My only quibble would be maybe for some darker greens, but that is more of a personal thing. <br/> <br/>Ps. The ball in flight is amazing.</td>', 'Hello Jeffrey... comment is per the critique club. Really not too much to say. The execution and relevance to the challenge is spot on. The square format is perfect as it emphasizes the middle and really anyone wanting to understand when to use the square format should look here. The zoom effect and rotation really adds zip to the photo and gives it an exciting energy. Emotions are subjective to say the least, and I think anxiety is a good choice here.  My only quibble would be maybe for some darker greens, but that is more of a personal thing.  Ps. The ball in flight is amazing.', '2008-10-09 16:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5001813, 725551, 30982, '<td valign="top">Howdy, neighbor!  I think both our shots next to each other really do make a nice pair.</td>', 'Howdy, neighbor!  I think both our shots next to each other really do make a nice pair.', '2008-10-09 16:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5002969, 725228, 97796, '<td valign="top">SO sorry this didn''t win. I love it! I would have given it a 10! Great Job!!!!<br/></td>', 'SO sorry this didn''t win. I love it! I would have given it a 10! Great Job!!!!', '2008-10-10 15:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5003781, 725765, 13025, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS! Keep up the good work! Michael</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS! Keep up the good work! Michael', '2008-10-11 06:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5003785, 726074, 55838, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Very cool feel to this image.  Nice textures and lines and - of course - those great Yanko tones.  I love the little lone tear droplet in the upper left.  I see that the splash of yellow was sorely needed on your profile page too....well it''s FINALLY there - phew!  : )  Very well done.  {BTW...I''m comin'' to get your average Baby!}</td>', 'Congratulations!  Very cool feel to this image.  Nice textures and lines and - of course - those great Yanko tones.  I love the little lone tear droplet in the upper left.  I see that the splash of yellow was sorely needed on your profile page too....well it''s FINALLY there - phew!  : )  Very well done.  {BTW...I''m comin'' to get your average Baby!}', '2008-10-11 06:57:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5003912, 726074, 24951, '<td valign="top">I love working in black and white and dark tones. Ooooooh I''m so envious!I''ve gotta try to decipher your editing notes. LucisArts is one of those  programs I hoping to buy. Hmmm I''ll have to try out the Efex plug in you''ve mentioned. The clarity/detail is outstanding. Thanks for sharing. Much success.</td>', 'I love working in black and white and dark tones. Ooooooh I''m so envious!I''ve gotta try to decipher your editing notes. LucisArts is one of those  programs I hoping to buy. Hmmm I''ll have to try out the Efex plug in you''ve mentioned. The clarity/detail is outstanding. Thanks for sharing. Much success.', '2008-10-11 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5004022, 726037, 36606, '<td valign="top">such a great idea. congrats on a great photo and the ribbon</td>', 'such a great idea. congrats on a great photo and the ribbon', '2008-10-11 12:53:58.000000', NULL, 0),
