(5005049, 725242, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like mine was the only negative comment and one of the few under 5 votes on this. Oh well, you know what opinions are like! Flag me as a troll if you like. (However, trolls don''t leave comments explaining their low vote!)</td>', 'Looks like mine was the only negative comment and one of the few under 5 votes on this. Oh well, you know what opinions are like! Flag me as a troll if you like. (However, trolls don''t leave comments explaining their low vote!)', '2008-10-12 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5005158, 725988, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, it fits the challenge well imo. The image is well composed with nice exposure &amp; is nicely focused. What I really like is the transition in color from top to bottom &amp; the little spots of purple thrown in, they add interest. The green Light gives the image a nice focal point.The background is a nice touch it is not over powering but you know it is there &amp; it also has an interesting feel to it, they both (foreground &amp; background) really work well together here. I also like that you didn''t go overboard with the PPing, it is just right imo. Overall the image &amp; pping are well done, the image has nice color &amp; held my attention.</td>', 'Nice image, it fits the challenge well imo. The image is well composed with nice exposure & is nicely focused. What I really like is the transition in color from top to bottom & the little spots of purple thrown in, they add interest. The green Light gives the image a nice focal point.The background is a nice touch it is not over powering but you know it is there & it also has an interesting feel to it, they both (foreground & background) really work well together here. I also like that you didn''t go overboard with the PPing, it is just right imo. Overall the image & pping are well done, the image has nice color & held my attention.', '2008-10-12 16:24:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5010569, 725988, 98542, '<td valign="top">yeeeehaaawww Pi</td>', 'yeeeehaaawww Pi', '2008-10-15 19:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5011307, 725619, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and capture. You did a great job avoiding unwanted reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and capture. You did a great job avoiding unwanted reflections.', '2008-10-16 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5011985, 726080, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I stumbled across this again because I saw this during the challenge and wanted to know what it meant.  You are wickedly clever for taking a picture of peeling paint lol.  I thought it kind of looked like a heart.  Congrats on a great score and your new 3rd PB!</td>', 'I''m glad I stumbled across this again because I saw this during the challenge and wanted to know what it meant.  You are wickedly clever for taking a picture of peeling paint lol.  I thought it kind of looked like a heart.  Congrats on a great score and your new 3rd PB!', '2008-10-16 23:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5016216, 725719, 88136, '<td valign="top">haha my last comment sucked. i guess i was being too literal.  i like this photo, you just have to be in the right frame of mind to appreciate it i guess</td>', 'haha my last comment sucked. i guess i was being too literal.  i like this photo, you just have to be in the right frame of mind to appreciate it i guess', '2008-10-20 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5021270, 726014, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo... love the expression, the emotion, the colour. The fact that one eye seems to be missing really makes the fear jump out in this photo. The face looks desperate to find the missing eye, and seems to be targetting mine.</td>', 'Very cool photo... love the expression, the emotion, the colour. The fact that one eye seems to be missing really makes the fear jump out in this photo. The face looks desperate to find the missing eye, and seems to be targetting mine.', '2008-10-22 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5022001, 725415, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really did not take the time to look at this during the challenge.  It''s really cool!  I looks like an angel fluttering his wings.  And I love what looks like spikes of curly gold and silver hair too.  Neato.</td>', 'I really did not take the time to look at this during the challenge.  It''s really cool!  I looks like an angel fluttering his wings.  And I love what looks like spikes of curly gold and silver hair too.  Neato.', '2008-10-23 10:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5024092, 725415, 48228, '<td valign="top">I just <b>LOVE</b> this so so much.....</td>', 'I just LOVE this so so much.....', '2008-10-24 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5029380, 726080, 23098, '<td valign="top">Just seeing this today.  Congrats on this beautiful first page photo. Love the simplicity and colors. You have the hand and eye of the artist with the camera.</td>', 'Just seeing this today.  Congrats on this beautiful first page photo. Love the simplicity and colors. You have the hand and eye of the artist with the camera.', '2008-10-28 16:30:08.000000', NULL, 0);
