(5033108, 723985, 13390, '<td valign="top">I think this show was very underrated. It doesn''t necessarily meet that DPC cliche image, but it is very creative and well executed if I may add. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I think this show was very underrated. It doesn''t necessarily meet that DPC cliche image, but it is very creative and well executed if I may add. Keep up the good work!', '2008-10-30 14:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5041593, 723985, 91197, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Well executed (knowing the fact that you don''t have your own studio). Underrated with DPC criteria. But is it a real shot? IMO its more likely a graphic! A smart one but a graphic. I still like it. But real shots are more interesting aren''t they?</td>', 'Nice idea. Well executed (knowing the fact that you don''t have your own studio). Underrated with DPC criteria. But is it a real shot? IMO its more likely a graphic! A smart one but a graphic. I still like it. But real shots are more interesting aren''t they?', '2008-11-03 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
