(5188235, 725618, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is another of your special touch photos.  The mix of horizontal and vertical lines, with the frame, and broken by the main subject, all in low key color tones.  Just good photography overall.</td>', 'This is another of your special touch photos.  The mix of horizontal and vertical lines, with the frame, and broken by the main subject, all in low key color tones.  Just good photography overall.', '2009-01-12 22:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
